# 01_cliff_entrance (the world 1baa96c2), the layer 3 holds the six commandoes and the four
# cover points; the CoverFind state is forced once (the forcing spec makes its radius 120) and
# then the WallHang and WallDetach states.
@f30 layer 3
@f120 objs commando
@f160 send u05df Activate
@f200 place u05df player 5
@f260 fsm u05df CoverFind
@f320 fsm u05df WallHang
@f420 fsm u05df WallDetach
@f480 objs commando
